FEPBenz/
The FEP calculation in OPLS-AA benzene (no polarization, N=260).
12-A cutoffs in box.

FEPpolBenz/
The FEP calculation in polarizable (OPLS-AAP) benzene.
12-A cutoffs in box.

FEPwater/
The FEP calculation in TIP4P water box (N=500) with 10-A cutoffs.

FEPwatercap/
The FEP calculation in TIP4P water cap with 15-A radius and no cutoffs.

FEPgas/
The FEP calculation in the gas phase.

MCnoFEP/
MC simulation for Me4N+ in OPLS-AAP benzene.
12-A cutoffs in box.

MCpolNoFEP/
MC simulation for Me4N+ in OPLS-AA  benzene.
12-A cutoffs in box.
